            "accordion_row_7BhDJU": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How should I care for my Lisandra garments?",
                "open_by_default": false
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Ymif9F": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>To preserve the beauty and shape of your delicate knit and crochet pieces, follow these care instructions:</p><ul><li><strong>Hand Wash Only:</strong> Gently hand wash in cold water with a mild detergent. Avoid scrubbing or wringing the fabric.</li><li><strong>Do Not Machine Wash or Tumble Dry:</strong>Machine washing or tumble drying can stretch, shrink, or damage the delicate fibers.</li><li><strong>Lay Flat to Dry:</strong> After washing, reshape the garment and lay it flat to air dry. Avoid hanging, as this may cause stretching or misshaping.</li><li><strong>Store with Care:</strong> Always fold rather than hang. </li></ul><p>Each Lisandra piece is handmade with care, treat it gently to enjoy it season after season.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
