            "accordion_row_6xf4Y7": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_dash_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What are Lisandra's sustainability practices?",
                "open_by_default": false
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_J6T8mz": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We are committed to slow fashion, creating timeless, high-quality pieces that are made to last. Each garment is handcrafted in Bali by local artisans, supporting traditional craftsmanship and ethical production. By producing in small, limited batches, we minimize waste and avoid overproduction.</p><p>Our materials are carefully selected with sustainability in mind, favoring natural fibers and low-impact processes whenever possible. To reduce our environmental footprint, we use reusable tote bags and biodegradable poly mailers for our packaging.</p><p>By choosing Lisandra, you're not only embracing effortless resort elegance, you’re also supporting mindful fashion that values people, the planet, and the art of handmade design.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
